#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. モノクマじゃなくて、テレビでも見られたらな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I'd\n"
"much rather be able to watch regular TV...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここから出ても、
#. しばらくは監視カメラがトラウマになりそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Assuming I make it out of here alive, I'll never look\n"
"at surveillance cameras the same way again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…モノクマの像か…
#. こんな物…誰が作ったんだよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this...a statue of Monokuma? Who would ever want to\n"
"make something like this?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…ビーナス像か…
#. 美術室らしいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...a Venus statue. Seems like something you'd find\n"
"in an art room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>壁一面に絵が張られている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are paintings lining the walls.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これも…芸術なのかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are these all handmade art pieces?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、仁王像だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is a statue of Nio.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>デッサン用の仁王像なんて…
#. 聞いた事ないぞ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I've never really heard of anyone using a Nio statue\n"
"for life drawing classes or whatever...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーがある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a locker.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>気になる物はないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's nothing too remarkable about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
